To build and deploy the site on Replit AI, a detailed single-page prompt was crafted with clear visual and structural specifications. 
The visual design employs a cream, sage green, and warm orange color palette, rounded cards, attractive typography, and real-life animal photography rather than cartoons or illustrations. 
Structured as one continuous scrolling page, the layout integrates ten distinct sections: a navigation bar, a hero section ("Where Every Pet Feels at Home"), 
About Us, Our Pet Guests, Services, a photo gallery, a booking inquiry form, a Why Choose Us section, client testimonials paired with an expandable FAQ, and a contact footer. 
In terms of functionality, the website supports smooth scrolling navigation, mobile responsiveness, interactive FAQ toggles, and a booking inquiry form equipped with required-field and 
date validation that displays a demo confirmation upon submission.

Through this activity, I learned how to create a website using Replit AI by giving clear instructions and prompts. I gained skills in planning a website's content, choosing appropriate
designs and colors, and adding useful features such as navigation links, FAQs, and a booking inquiry form. One challenge I faced was getting the website to match my desired design and 
making sure its features worked properly. I solved this by improving my prompts, making changes, and testing the website. In the future, I can apply these skills to create other websites 
and improve my knowledge of web design and technology.
